      "text": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\text{Cut equation: }\\theta \\geq \\alpha^k + {\\beta^k}^\\top x\\\\[4pt]\\text{where }\\alpha^k = Q_t - \\pi_t^\\top \\hat{x}_{t-1}\\\\\\text{and }\\beta^k = \\pi_t \\;\\text{(dual multiplier)}\\\\[4pt]\\underline{V}_t(x) = \\max_k \\{ \\alpha^k + {\\beta^k}^\\top x \\}\\end{gathered}$$",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 90,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
