      "originalText": "Cut equation:  θ ≥ αᵏ + βᵏᵀx\n\nwhere  αᵏ = Qₜ - πₜᵀx̂_{t-1}\nand      βᵏ = πₜ  (dual multiplier)\n\nV̲ₜ(x) = max_k { αᵏ + βᵏᵀx }",
      "autoResize": true,
